# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  API Keys Configuration — Copy this to .env and fill in your actual keys
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LOCATION: Must be in core/ directory (same level as manage.py)
# To create: cp core/.env.example core/.env
# Django settings.py will auto-load variables from this file using python-dotenv

# YOUTUBE DATA API v3
# Get a key: https://console.cloud.google.com
# Documentation: https://developers.google.com/youtube/v3
# Instructions:
#   1. Create a new project
#   2. Enable "YouTube Data API v3"
#   3. Create an API Key (not OAuth credentials)
#   4. Copy the key below
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_youtube_api_key_here

# UDEMY AFFILIATE API
# Get credentials: https://www.udemy.com/developers/affiliate/
# Documentation: https://www.udemy.com/developers/affiliate/#intro
# Instructions:
#   1. Sign in to Udemy
#   2. Request Affiliate Access
#   3. Copy Client ID and Client Secret
UDEMY_CLIENT_ID=your_udemy_client_id_here
UDEMY_CLIENT_SECRET=your_udemy_client_secret_here

# ANTHROPIC CLAUDE AI
# Get a key: https://console.anthropic.com/account/api-keys
# Documentation: https://docs.anthropic.com/claude/reference/getting-started-with-the-api
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# NOTE: Coursera API integration has been removed due to 405 errors in their backend

